        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Swap</strong> is a minimalist psychological puzzle game that challenges your perception and attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are placed in a room where every 30 seconds one object changes — its color or rotation. Your task is simple: spot the altered object and click on it. But be careful — mistakes cost lives, and you only have three.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the rounds continue, the tension builds. Music grows darker, your focus is tested, and one wrong choice can end your run. The game never ends — your only goal is to survive as long as you can and push your score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless gameplay loop — no victory, only survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects shift in different ways: colors or rotations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design with psychological atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives — lose them all, and the run resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable settings: audio, graphics, gameplay options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you trust your eyes? Or will the room deceive you?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Swap</strong> is a minimalist psychological puzzle game that challenges your perception and attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are placed in a room where every 30 seconds one object changes — its color or rotation. Your task is simple: spot the altered object and click on it. But be careful — mistakes cost lives, and you only have three.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the rounds continue, the tension builds. Music grows darker, your focus is tested, and one wrong choice can end your run. The game never ends — your only goal is to survive as long as you can and push your score higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless gameplay loop — no victory, only survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects shift in different ways: colors or rotations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design with psychological atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives — lose them all, and the run resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable settings: audio, graphics, gameplay options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you trust your eyes? Or will the room deceive you?</p>",
